{"shortname": "saga-gis", "name": "SAGA GIS", "_id": "5009a44871b75b2b83001d22", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/p/saga-gis/", "private": false, "short_description": "SAGA - System for Automated Geoscientific Analyses - is a Geographic Information System (GIS) software with immense capabilities for geodata processing and analysis. SAGA is programmed in the object oriented C++ language and supports the implementation of new functions with a very effective Application Programming Interface (API). Functions are organised as modules in framework independent Module Libraries and can be accessed via SAGA\u2019s Graphical User Interface (GUI) or various scripting environments (shell scripts, Python, R, ...).\r\n\r\nPlease provide the following reference in your work if you are using SAGA:\r\nConrad, O., Bechtel, B., Bock, M., Dietrich, H., Fischer, E., Gerlitz, L., Wehberg, J., Wichmann, V., and Boehner, J. (2015): System for Automated Geoscientific Analyses (SAGA) v. 2.1.4. Geosci. Model Dev., 8, 1991-2007, https://doi.org/10.5194/gmd-8-1991-2015.\r\n\r\nFor more information visit the project homepage and the wiki.", "creation_date": "2004-02-20", "summary": "", "external_homepage": "https://saga-gis.sourceforge.io/en/index.html", "video_url": null, "socialnetworks": [{"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Twitter"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Facebook"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Fediverse"}, {"accounturl": null, "socialnetwork": "Instagram"}], "status": "active", "moved_to_url": "", "preferred_support_tool": "discussion", "preferred_support_url": "", "developers": [{"username": "m_bock", "name": "Michael Bock", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/m_bock/"}, {"username": "reklov_w", "name": "Volker Wichmann", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/reklov_w/"}, {"username": "openwebcc", "name": "openweb.cc", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/openwebcc/"}, {"username": "rhurlin", "name": "Rainer Hurling", "url": "https://sourceforge.net/u/rhurlin/"}, {"us